      "options": [
        {
          "value": "yes",
          "label": "Yes"
        },
        {
          "value": "no",
          "label": "No"
        }
      ],
      "help": "Use the statutory requirement for a fartssertifikat. Section 1(2) limits chapters 6–14 to ships required to have a trading certificate or a vessel instruction.",
